Value Filldown KIND (Static|Dynamic)
Value Filldown VRF (\S+)
Value Required NEIGHBOR (\S+)

# Static and dynamic members of each peer group (feature 010, research R3): the neighbour view has
# no dynamic marker. Static members are recorded too, so a device whose groups have only static
# members still yields rows.
Start
  ^BGP peer-group is -> Clearall
  ^\s+${KIND} peer-group members:$$
  ^\s+VRF ${VRF}:$$
  ^\s+${NEIGHBOR}, state: \S+$$ -> Record
